trolled bass from compact enclosures. With its rigid anodized aluminum cone, dual-spider suspension, and a massive triple-stacked motor structure, the SS10-22 maintains pistonic accuracy and low distortion even at extreme excursion. A 2.5\" 4-layer copper voice coil on a vented aluminum former ensures excellent thermal handling, allowing the driver to manage up to 700 watts RMS without compression. Designed for DSP-assisted sealed enclosures or compact vented/passive radiator systems, the SS10-22 is equally at home in home theater, hi-fi listening rooms, or car audio installations where deep bass performance in a smaller footprint is required.Product HighlightsAluminum shorting sleeve, ring, and pole cap ensure linear inductance and ultra-low distortionRigid anodized aluminum cone with indexed edge for pistonic accuracy and reduced resonance2.5\" 4-layer copper voice coil on a vented aluminum former for superior power handling and coolingMassive triple-stacked magnet assembly delivers exceptional strength and symmetry at high excursionExtensive venting through cone, pole piece, spider, and gap minimizes thermal buildup and compressionDual spider suspension with stitched tinsel leads for precise pistonic motion and enhanced durabilityProduct Manuals / Spec Sheets / DownloadsDayton Audio SS10-22 Specification SheetDayton Audio SS10-22 Graphs/FRD/ZMA Data FileBuying OptionsBuy on Parts ExpressBuy Internationally"},"surround_material":{"value":"Rubber"},"provided_by":{"value":"OpenIsd"},"comment":{"value":"Generated by OpenIsd"},"added":{"value":"2026-09-12"},"specs":{"woofer":{"Fs_hz":{"origin":"manufacturer_datasheet","readings":{"manufacturer_datasheet":{"actual_reading":"34 Hz","read_value":34,"read_precision":0.5},"manufacturer_product_page":{"actual_reading":"34 Hz","read_value":34,"read_precision":0.5}},"corroboration":"MATCH"},"Re_ohm":{"origin":"manufacturer_datasheet","readings":{"manufacturer_datasheet":{"actual_reading":"4.4 ohms","read_value":4.4,"read_prec